    "name":  "Amanat Weather Risk",
    "description":  "Parametric weather-risk signals for autonomous systems. Every answer carries a plain-language summary and the scalars behind it â temperature, wind, gusts, precipitation and a storm-risk score â so the same response can be graded by a Telegraph scoring module and acted on by a smart contract through an ERC-8183 job. Backed by Open-Meteo; no API key, no rate-limit surprises.\n",
